COMMENT                Wen Quan Yi Bitmap Song 
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT Summary:
COMMENT 
COMMENT     	Authors  : WenQuanYi Contributors
COMMENT     	Webpage  : http://wenq.org/en/
